    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Stage 1: Inbound IVR\nTwilio's Voice webhook for the client's number points at the \"Inbound Call\" webhook below.\n\nFlow:\n1. Call arrives -> greeting + Gather (Press 1 / Press 2)\n2. Twilio POSTs the pressed digit to \"Gather Result\"\n3. Digit 1 -> <Dial> straight to reception (pure Twilio forwarding, no AI)\n4. Digit 2 -> <Dial><Sip> handoff to the Vapi assistant (see README for Vapi SIP Trunking setup)\n\nSet the Twilio number's Voice webhook (in the Twilio Console, or via the Twilio node) to:\nhttps://keystoneconsultancy.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/twilio/inbound-call",
          "height": 320,
          "width": 420
        },
        "id": "ivr-note",
